{"type":"message","id":"ed368112","parentId":"44354265","timestamp":"2026-03-20T21:42:28.237Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"2388\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"sender\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-03-20 21:42 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Klaus Ampler (8437938758)\",\n  \"id\": \"8437938758\",\n  \"name\": \"Klaus Ampler\",\n  \"username\": \"klausampler\"\n}\n```\n\nok lets start new project.\n\nlets say we gonna create an application which will be able to scrape and keep fresh data from livesport.cz. Into some kind of db/cache. from where our UI will be showing it. I am only interested in LIVE football matches.\n\nu as a CEO should manage this project, step by step.\n\nIf you will miss some premissions or you will need some clarification let me know."}],"timestamp":1774042948223}}
{"type":"message","id":"ce8d2493","parentId":"ed368112","timestamp":"2026-03-20T21:42:56.788Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"User wants to start a new project for scraping live football data from livesport.cz - I need to create an execution plan and spawn the coder agent to handle the technical implementation.\n</think>\n\nGot it. We're building a live football match scraper + cache + UI. Let me break this down:\n\n**Phase 1: Research & Planning**\n- Check what livesport.cz exposes (API, HTML structure, rate limits)\n- Determine what data we need (match status, scores, events, stats)\n- Plan the data model for our cache\n\n**Phase 2: Backend/Scraper**\n- Build the scraper that polls live matches\n- Set up a database/cache (PostgreSQL or Redis?)\n- Handle authentication if needed\n\n**Phase 3: UI**\n- Build a dashboard showing live matches\n- Real-time updates\n\nBefore I spawn the coder agent to start Phase 1, I have a question:\n\n**Do you want to store scraped data persistently, or is cache-only acceptable?** And **what's your preferred stack for the UI** (web dashboard, CLI, mobile app)?\n\nOnce you clarify, I'll kick off the coder agent to research livesport.cz structure."}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"vllm","model":"mlx-community/Qwen3.5-35B-A3B-4bit","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774042948230}}
